    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of Mega Snaileeyo Adventure. You\u2019ll help Snaileeyo dodge enemies, blast them with flower petals, duck and hide in your shell, and collect items to feed Runpos to get them to open up new places. You play in a 2.5D mode and 3D mode, going through an tunnels, exploring caverns, trekking across an open world encountering weird enemies, platforming across treacherous territories, battling zany bosses, and unlocking new areas, solving puzzles\u2014and that\u2019s only the start! Oh yeah there is also an orthographic mode woohoo! So lets\u2019s slide into Snaileeyo and face the challenges and take back the crystals from Rocky.",
